<table height="400" width="550" cellpadding="5" border="0" cellspacing="5" >
<tr height="400" valign="top" >
<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<span id="docs-internal-guid-6027ef11-3686-c069-5212-e33a8945db22"><p dir="ltr" style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 13px; font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">{!Contact.FirstName},</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size: 13px; font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><br></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><font size="2">Thank you for your interest in the graduate programs of the School of Earth and Space Exploration at Arizona State University! Our innovative, interdisciplinary school currently offers MS and PhD degrees in both Astrophysics and Geological Sciences as well as a PhD in Exploration Systems Design. </font></span></p><font size="2"><br></font><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><font size="2">Admission</font></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><font size="2"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Our graduate program includes MS and PhD degrees in both Astrophysics and Geological Sciences and a PhD in Exploration Systems Design. We also offer an MNS in Geological Sciences. It is very different from our other thesis-based degrees. It requires a faculty mentor who is willing to supervise an applied project rather than a thesis for a student to be admitted. If you would like to apply for the MNS, I would highly recommend that you make contact with potential faculty mentors to receive an endorsement for your admission. The faculty member will help you determine the nature of the applied project and what classes you would take. Please see our research webpages <a href="http://sese.asu.edu/focus_areas">http://sese.asu.edu/focus_areas</a></span><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"> for more information on our faculty and their research.&nbsp;</span></font></span></p><font size="2"><br></font><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><font size="2"><span style="font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Admission is possible for both spring and fall semesters, however spring admission is </span><span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">very</span><span style="font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> </span><span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">limited</span><span style="font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">. To be admitted to a spring semester, a student must have an arrangement with a faculty member who endorses her or his application and has the funding to support the student as a research assistant. </span></font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><font size="2"><span style="font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">We strongly recommend that all applicants review our </span><a href="http://sese.asu.edu/focus_areas" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="font-family: Arial; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">research focus website</span></a><span style="font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> to identify faculty members who share similar research interests. We encourage you to contact these faculty members for more information regarding their research program. These connections can greatly enhance an applicant's visibility for admission and can help identify potential research project ideas should the applicant be admitted to our program. </span></font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><font size="2">Note: All of our application materials are submitted electronically. Applicants must provide all of the required materials to be considered for admission.</font></span></p><font size="2"><br></font><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><font size="2">Additional Questions?</font></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><font size="2"><span style="font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Please visit our </span><a href="http://sese.asu.edu/gradstudentFAQ" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="font-family: Arial; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">FAQ</span></a><span style="font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> page for additional information. After you have reviewed our site or contacted prospective faculty advisors, please feel free to contact me with specific questions about our graduate programs and the admission process. </span></font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><font size="2">I hope this information is helpful. Have a great day!</font></span></p><font size="2"><br></font><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><font size="2">Becca Dial</font></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><font size="2">Academic Support Specialist</font></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><font size="2">School of Earth and Space Exploration</font></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><font size="2">PO Box 876004</font></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><font size="2">Tempe, AZ 85287-6004</font></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><font size="2"><span style="font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Email: </span><a href="mailto:bdial@asu.edu" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="font-family: Arial; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">bdial@asu.edu</span></a></font></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.15; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><font size="2">Phone: 480-965-2213</font></span></p><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 13px; font-family: Arial; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><br></span></div></span>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>